<title>JAPAN: Daiichi Jitsugyo -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Daiichi Jitsugyo -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.22		vs	   38.09</p>
<p> Operating	  687    million	  vs	  504    million</p>
<p> Current	    877    million	  vs	  672    million</p>
<p> Net		  296    million	  vs	  159    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.15 yen	  vs	    2.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     57 million	  vs	  57 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Daiichi Jitsugyo Co Ltd is a trading company specialising in machinery.</p>
</text>
